# Docker build context exclusions (modelled on iam-user-profile's).
#
# This module is a library with no Dockerfile of its own. The file applies
# when the repository is used as a build context, for example a consuming
# service that builds against a local checkout. It keeps that context to
# what `go build ./pkg/...` needs: go.mod, go.sum and pkg/ (the embedded SQL
# migrations live under pkg/). Volume mounts in docker-compose.yml, such as
# scripts/init-floci.sh, are not affected by this file.

# Version control
.git
.gitignore
.githooks/
.github/

# Environment files — never bake secrets into an image
.env
.env.*
*.env
.env-example

# Development tooling and docs
.claude/
docs/
scripts/
tools/
*.md
ARCHITECTURE.md
README.md
Makefile
docker-compose.yml
.editorconfig
.golangci.yml
.go-arch-lint.yml

# Test artefacts
test/
**/*_test.go
.coverage/
coverage.out
coverage.html
*.coverprofile

# Build artefacts already compiled outside Docker
bin/

# IDE and OS noise
.idea/
.vscode/
*.DS_Store
*.swp
*.swo

# Go tool cache (not needed in an image)
vendor/
